 "info": {
  "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official Cloud Data Fusion API (v1) discovery document. Every other official method returns HTTP 501 UNIMPLEMENTED. Instances and DNS peerings are configuration metadata: no CDAP, pipeline, Dataproc cluster, bucket, service endpoint or DNS zone exists, and instances report ACTIVE immediately. Restart, version listing and IAM policy methods are unimplemented; Resource Manager tags are refused; deleting an instance with DNS peerings requires force=true.",
  "title": "Cloud Data Fusion (simulator catalog)",
  "version": "v1"
 },
